{"unit_id": "tag:02J3:proof", "translation": "若<MATH_0001>是某个域（field）的谱（spectrum），则这正是引理<REF_0001>。在一般情形下，结论由局部有限型（locally of finite type）的态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）仍是局部有限型（locally of finite type）得出（引理<REF_0002>）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "指取谱所用的域。"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "指域的谱。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "修饰参与复合的态射。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指参与复合的态射。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "指态射的复合。"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型", "context": "描述复合所得态射的性质。"}], "notes": []}
